  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a bowl, knead the barramundi fillets for 5 minutes until tender.",
    "Heat the corn oil in a wok over high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and stir-fry for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the scallions and stir-fry for another 30 seconds.",
    "Add the shrimp and stir-fry until pink, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the kung pao sauce and honey and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the water chestnuts and sesame seeds and stir-fry for another 30 seconds.",
    "Add the kneaded barramundi fillets and stir-fry until cooked through, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Serve immediately and garnish with additional scallions if desired.",
    "Pair with a side of steamed broccoli for a complete meal."
